{"seq":2,"slug":"spark-computing","title":"Spark 计算引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms/spark-computing","wordCount":782,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"spark-计算引擎\">Spark 计算引擎</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>Apache Spark 以其内存计算优势和统一的编程模型，成为企业级大数据处理的首选引擎。相比 MapReduce 频繁的磁盘 I/O，Spark 将中间结果缓存在内存中，在迭代计算场景下性能提升 10-100 倍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"rdd-弹性分布式数据集\">RDD 弹性分布式数据集</h3><p>RDD（Resilient Distributed Dataset）是 Spark 最底层的数据抽象，代表一个不可变的、可并行操作的元素集合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pyspark import SparkContext&#10;&#10;sc = SparkContext(&quot;local[*]&quot;, &quot;RDD Demo&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 创建 RDD&#10;lines = sc.textFile(&quot;hdfs:///logs/access.log&quot;)&#10;&#10;# Transformation（惰性求值，不会立即执行）&#10;words = lines.flatMap(lambda line: line.split(&quot; &quot;))&#10;pairs = words.map(lambda w: (w, 1))&#10;counts = pairs.reduceByKey(lambda a, b: a + b)&#10;&#10;# Action（触发实际计算）&#10;top10 = counts.top(10, key=lambda x: x[1])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SparkContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SparkContext(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"local[*]\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RDD Demo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建 RDD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lines </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sc.textFile(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hdfs:///logs/access.log\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Transformation（惰性求值，不会立即执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">words </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lines.flatMap(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line: line.split(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\" \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pairs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> words.map(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w: (w, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pairs.reduceByKey(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, b: a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Action（触发实际计算）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">top10 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counts.top(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x: x[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>RDD 的核心特性：<strong>惰性求值</strong>（Transformation 只记录计算图，Action 才触发执行）、<strong>血缘关系</strong>（Lineage）用于容错恢复、<strong>分区</strong>（Partition）决定并行度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dataframe-与-dataset-api\">DataFrame 与 Dataset API</h3><p>DataFrame 是带有 Schema 的分布式数据表，提供比 RDD 更高级的声明式 API 和更强的优化能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession&#10;from pyspark.sql import functions as F&#10;from pyspark.sql.window import Window&#10;&#10;spark = SparkSession.builder.appName(&quot;DataFrame Demo&quot;).getOrCreate()&#10;&#10;# 读取 Parquet 数据&#10;df = spark.read.parquet(&quot;hdfs:///dw/dwd/user_orders&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 链式转换&#10;result = (&#10;    df.filter(F.col(&quot;status&quot;) == &quot;completed&quot;)&#10;      .withColumn(&quot;order_month&quot;, F.date_format(&quot;created_at&quot;, &quot;yyyy-MM&quot;))&#10;      .groupBy(&quot;order_month&quot;, &quot;category&quot;)&#10;      .agg(&#10;          F.sum(&quot;amount&quot;).alias(&quot;total_revenue&quot;),&#10;          F.countDistinct(&quot;user_id&quot;).alias(&quot;buyers&quot;),&#10;          F.avg(&quot;amount&quot;).alias(&quot;avg_order_value&quot;)&#10;      )&#10;      .orderBy(F.desc(&quot;total_revenue&quot;))&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 窗口函数&#10;window_spec = Window.partitionBy(&quot;user_id&quot;).orderBy(&quot;created_at&quot;)&#10;df_with_rank = df.withColumn(&#10;    &quot;order_seq&quot;, F.row_number().over(window_spec)&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.sql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SparkSession</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.sql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.sql.window </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Window</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">spark </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SparkSession.builder.appName(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DataFrame Demo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).getOrCreate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 读取 Parquet 数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spark.read.parquet(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hdfs:///dw/dwd/user_orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 链式转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    df.filter(F.col(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"completed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .withColumn(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_month\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, F.date_format(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yyyy-MM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .groupBy(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_month\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .agg(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          F.sum(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).alias(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_revenue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          F.countDistinct(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).alias(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"buyers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          F.avg(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).alias(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"avg_order_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .orderBy(F.desc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_revenue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 窗口函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">window_spec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Window.partitionBy(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).orderBy(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df_with_rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df.withColumn(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"order_seq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, F.row_number().over(window_spec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DataFrame API 经过 Catalyst 优化器和 Tungsten 执行引擎的双重加持，在大多数场景下性能优于手写 RDD 代码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"spark-sql-查询引擎\">Spark SQL 查询引擎</h3><p>Spark SQL 让 SQL 分析师无需学习编程即可利用 Spark 的分布式计算能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 注册临时视图&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE TEMP VIEW active_users AS&#10;SELECT user_id, COUNT(*) AS order_count, SUM(amount) AS total_spent&#10;FROM user_orders&#10;WHERE status = &#39;completed&#39;&#10;  AND created_at &gt;= &#39;2026-01-01&#39;&#10;GROUP BY user_id&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 3;&#10;&#10;-- 用户分层分析&#10;SELECT&#10;    CASE&#10;        WHEN total_spent &gt;= 10000 THEN &#39;高价值&#39;&#10;        WHEN total_spent &gt;= 3000 THEN &#39;中价值&#39;&#10;        ELSE &#39;低价值&#39;&#10;    END AS user_tier,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS user_count,&#10;    AVG(total_spent) AS avg_spent&#10;FROM active_users&#10;GROUP BY 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 注册临时视图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TEMP VIEW active_users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_count, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_spent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 用户分层分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_spent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '高价值'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_spent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '中价值'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '低价值'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_tier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_spent) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_spent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active_users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Spark SQL 支持 ANSI SQL 标准，并扩展了 <code>LATERAL VIEW</code>、<code>TRANSFORM</code> 等大数据特有语法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"mllib-机器学习库\">MLlib 机器学习库</h3><p>MLlib 提供开箱即用的分布式机器学习算法，适合大规模数据集上的模型训练：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pyspark.ml import Pipeline&#10;from pyspark.ml.feature import VectorAssembler, StandardScaler&#10;from pyspark.ml.classification import RandomForestClassifier&#10;from pyspark.ml.evaluation import BinaryClassificationEvaluator&#10;&#10;# 特征工程&#10;assembler = VectorAssembler(&#10;    inputCols=[&quot;age&quot;, &quot;income&quot;, &quot;login_days&quot;, &quot;order_count&quot;],&#10;    outputCol=&quot;raw_features&quot;&#10;)&#10;scaler = StandardScaler(inputCol=&quot;raw_features&quot;, outputCol=&quot;features&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 模型定义&#10;rf = RandomForestClassifier(&#10;    labelCol=&quot;is_churn&quot;, featuresCol=&quot;features&quot;,&#10;    numTrees=100, maxDepth=8&#10;)&#10;&#10;# Pipeline 管道&#10;pipeline = Pipeline(stages=[assembler, scaler, rf])&#10;model = pipeline.fit(train_df)&#10;&#10;# 评估&#10;predictions = model.transform(test_df)&#10;evaluator = BinaryClassificationEvaluator(labelCol=&quot;is_churn&quot;)&#10;auc = evaluator.evaluate(predictions)&#10;print(f&quot;AUC: {auc:.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.ml </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.ml.feature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VectorAssembler, StandardScaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.ml.classification </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomForestClassifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.ml.evaluation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BinaryClassificationEvaluator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></sp